# Plains from the graveyard. Bot2 casts its own Looting on turn 2 with Mox Ruby and two more Moxen open, and is refused
# the flashback ({2}{R}); on turn 3 Bot1, with Mox Ruby, Jet and Pearl untapped, is refused its own.

